# Build context for every image. Without this, the whole repo — including
# node_modules and .next — is sent to the daemon on each build.

node_modules
**/node_modules

dist
**/dist
.next
**/.next
coverage
**/coverage
*.tsbuildinfo

.git
.github

# Secrets never belong in an image; samples are enough to document the contract.
.env
**/.env
.env.*
**/.env.*
!**/.env.sample

docs
**/docs
*.md
!README.md

.vscode
.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store
npm-debug.log*
postgres-data
